{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in a cozy base-building adventure! Take care of adorable creatures \u2014 Morps, explore, discover new species, grow crops, fish, build relationships with your crew, decorate your perfect home, and automate production along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/ceea0913efc131136246dd802b73da3f.poster.avif?t=1765477257\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/ceea0913efc131136246dd802b73da3f.webm?t=1765477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/ceea0913efc131136246dd802b73da3f.mp4?t=1765477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Cozy Experience!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 players</strong> \u2013 Time to Morp is a great solo experience, but it is even more fun with friends!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care of Morps</strong> \u2013 the world is full of cute and unique creatures. They'll help you gather resources or just roll around with you as you explore the vibrant planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing, farming, cooking</strong> \u2013 relaxing and rewarding activities to unwind! Catch fish in serene waters, plant and tend to your crops, harvest rare ingredients, and cook up some mouthwatering dishes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/825c8fd0441c39e67f6b072a53689ba7.poster.avif?t=1765477257\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/825c8fd0441c39e67f6b072a53689ba7.webm?t=1765477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977510/extras/825c8fd0441c39e67f6b072a53689ba7.mp4?t=1765477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate everything</strong> \u2013 water and gather resources yourself, or let the machines handle it all, so you can focus on the exciting adventures ahead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal home</strong> \u2013 build a small or big house, not just for yourself, but for each of your friends. Express yourself by decorating it however you like with over 300 decor items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own town</strong> \u2013 build and design the entire city! As you expand, you'll unlock awesome decor to make an island even more unique and truly yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet your crew</strong> \u2013 meet different characters in your crew, each with their unique style to help you solve the mystery of the planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> \u2013 explore an island full of activities, unique resources, secrets and biomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Intern on your first mission, you have an opportunity to prove yourself, befriend the Crew, or discover secrets of this unknown planet! Follow the story to find the source of a SOS signal that brought you here, help creatures in distress, and help a lost soul to rejoin her family.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f4b28145e060ba03e524614b90de690f7343b9b0.jpg","localized_name":"One very smart Intern","name":"One very smart Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/f4b28145e060ba03e524614b90de690f7343b9b0.jpg"},{"icon":"f78dc5a65abb92c3a4679274fe3d1c4b0cff0a87.jpg","localized_name":"Time to Style","name":"Time to Style","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/f78dc5a65abb92c3a4679274fe3d1c4b0cff0a87.jpg"},{"icon":"72cbd6cea530fe9766ebad940269265b15bb60b2.jpg","localized_name":"Mission Accomplished","name":"Mission Accomplished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/72cbd6cea530fe9766ebad940269265b15bb60b2.jpg"},{"icon":"688192018ce52f5a61af6a27c94f7188cb8b05c6.jpg","localized_name":"Fauna Savior","name":"Fauna Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/688192018ce52f5a61af6a27c94f7188cb8b05c6.jpg"},{"icon":"ab7a53c5e5bf976fbba6c4f4c060061cec731b50.jpg","localized_name":"Solid Ground","name":"Solid Ground","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/ab7a53c5e5bf976fbba6c4f4c060061cec731b50.jpg"},{"icon":"3f0558f674cd9bdb05b1b63f5618287ff6574dd9.jpg","localized_name":"Morp Master","name":"Morp Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/3f0558f674cd9bdb05b1b63f5618287ff6574dd9.jpg"},{"icon":"5e9ac761d752e95e6194af6ca87b4f4700e9bcd8.jpg","localized_name":"Friends Forever","name":"Friends Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/5e9ac761d752e95e6194af6ca87b4f4700e9bcd8.jpg"},{"icon":"559605bfefefbbeb3d8a43b3949282462eeb6411.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to the Family","name":"Welcome to the Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977510/559605bfefefbbeb3d8a43b3949282462eeb6411.jpg"},{"icon":"c05b2fd16a564dc8822a8620c9b50f70b4982f79.jpg","localized_name":"Soul of the Company","name":"Soul of the Company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu